      "writtenOn": "2021-12-17T00:13:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "similarly do we want to have uclamp_can_ignore_uclamp_min as well?\n\nin pixel, we have a threashold for ignoring uclamp_min for smaller tasks as well, the boost is usually for making the deadline, and transient task usually doesn\u0027t matter.",
